>currently too wonderful IMAO.					Allen K.

Another option is to have a max-strength or stats based on your level.
I.E, you can't get past 18/50 without being above level 15 or something like
that.  Or you can't get past a 17 stat in Dexterity, Wisdom , Intelligence
without being level 10.  


